Package: objectfilemanager
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Primož Ajdišek <bigpod@bigpod.si>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libgtk-3-0, libnss3, libnspr4, libatk1.0-0, libatk-bridge2.0-0, libcups2, libdbus-1-3, libcairo2, libpango-1.0-0, libx11-6, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxrandr2, libgbm1, libexpat1, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libudev1, libasound2, libatspi2.0-0, libglib2.0-0, libgcc-s1, libsecret-1-0, ca-certificates
Recommends: gnome-keyring
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: Desktop browser and bulk transfer client for object storage
 Browse Amazon S3, S3-compatible services, OpenStack Swift, Azure Blob Storage
 and Google Cloud Storage.
 Upload and download folder trees through a persistent queue with pause and
 retry, and review copies, moves, deletions and one-way folder syncs.
